      "message": "Say where a built release is fetched from, and how to check it\n\nThe first tagged release, 0.1.0-alpha.1, is built on the reference\ninstance and published under dl.cairn.mandip.dev with the checksums\nbeside it. The README's try-it and the operating guide's Installing now\nname that path for x86_64 Linux, with the checksum step before the\nunpack, and keep the source install for everywhere else. The build stamp\nalso watches refs/tags, so a build made at a tag says the tag's name, and\nthe release script calls the uploader through python, since the first\npublish found it committed without its execute bit.\n\nChange-Id: Idocs0091download\nSigned-off-by: Mandip Adhikari <92096340+mandipadk@users.noreply.github.com>",
